<section class="content-section">
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>At Better Keep Notes, we respect your right to control your personal data. This page explains how you
        can request deletion of your account and data, what data will be deleted, the deletion timeline, and
        how you can recover your account if you change your mind.</p>

      <div class="highlight-box">
        <p><strong>Your Rights:</strong> Under data protection regulations including GDPR and similar laws, you
          have the right to request deletion of your personal data. We make this process straightforward and
          transparent.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>How to Delete Your Account</h2>
      <p>You can request account deletion directly from within the Better Keep Notes app:</p>

      <div class="steps-container">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">1</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4>Open the App</h4>
            <p>Launch Better Keep Notes on any of your devices and sign in to your account.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">2</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4>Go to Your Profile</h4>
            <p>Tap on your profile picture or avatar in the top corner to access your account settings.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">3</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4>Find "Danger Zone"</h4>
            <p>Scroll down to the "Danger Zone" section at the bottom of your profile page.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">4</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4>Tap "Delete My Account"</h4>
            <p>Click the "Delete My Account" button. A warning dialog will appear explaining the consequences.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">5</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4>Confirm Deletion</h4>
            <p>Review the warning carefully and tap "Delete Account" to proceed to the verification step.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">6</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4>Verify Your Email</h4>
            <p>A 6-digit verification code will be sent to your registered email address. Enter this code to
              confirm you own the account. The code expires in 10 minutes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">7</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4>Deletion Scheduled</h4>
            <p>Once verified, your account will be scheduled for permanent deletion after 30 days. You can cancel
              by signing back in during this grace period.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">8</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4>Export Your Data (Optional)</h4>
            <p>After deletion is scheduled, you'll be offered to export your data before being signed out.
              Click "Export Data" to download a ZIP file containing all your notes and attachments, or "Skip"
              to sign out immediately.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="success-box">
        <p><strong> Tip:</strong> We strongly recommend exporting your data when prompted after scheduling deletion.
          The export includes all your notes, labels, and attachments in a portable ZIP format that you can
          keep for your records or import into other applications.</p>
      </div>

      <h3>Alternative: Contact Us</h3>
      <p>If you cannot access the app or prefer to request deletion via email, you can contact us at
        <a href="mailto:contact@betterkeep.app">contact@betterkeep.app</a> with the subject line "Account Deletion
        Request".
        Please include the email address associated with your account for verification.
      </p>
    </section>

